{"nodes": [{"id": "_github_workflows_ci_ci", "label": "CI Workflow (ci.yml)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The authoritative engineering gate: before it existed every '0 Warnings/0 Errors, N/N tests passing' claim was a self-reported assertion (WP11.0A finding R-1). Push runs only main, release/** and tags; other branches are gated by their PR to avoid double runs."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_build_and_test", "label": "build-and-test job (Debug/Release x core/desktop-1/2/3 matrix)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pinned to windows-2022 (not windows-latest) because the project pins every other version exactly; whole-leg timeout back to 45 min once sharding split the single dotnet test invocation."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_governance_health_check", "label": "governance-health-check job", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Independent of build-and-test: a governance-document inconsistency is orthogonal to whether the code compiles, so it runs in parallel. Read-only. Promoted from advisory to required at WP 16.1A after five releases of real drift."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_dependency_scan", "label": "dependency-scan job (dotnet list package --vulnerable)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "dotnet list package --vulnerable exits 0 regardless, so it is paired with check-vulnerable-packages.ps1 which fails on any finding or unparsable scan. Whole solution in one invocation, mirroring Restore."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_linux_launch_smoke", "label": "linux-launch-smoke job (advisory)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Launches the built Tempest.Desktop.dll under Xvfb; timeout exit (124/137) plus both late-startup markers counts as success. Deliberately NOT in gate's needs and continue-on-error, because new-release.ps1 reads the run conclusion before tagging. Its existence does not make Linux CI-verified (D-025)."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_mutation", "label": "mutation job (Stryker.NET)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Scoped to Calculations and UnitsAndQuantities; runs only on schedule (Monday 06:00 UTC) or workflow_dispatch because a mutation pass is far slower than build-and-test and is diagnostic, not a merge gate."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_gate", "label": "CI Gate job", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A single named job every branch-protection rule can require, so 'the pipeline is green' is one status check. Strict -ne 'success' so failure, cancelled and skipped all fail; if: always() so a cancelled run reports red rather than skipped."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_test_sharding", "label": "Desktop test sharding by first letter of namespace segment (A-D / E-P / Q-Z)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "WP 20.3D: the whole-leg timeout kept rising (30->45->90) because one dotnet test ran the whole solution in series. Letter ranges mean every future class lands in exactly one shard with no filter list to maintain (CiShardCoverageTests enforces), at the cost of tracking count not time. Each leg's command is spelled out literally because pwsh mishandled a conditionally splatted argument array."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_adr_0160", "label": "ADR-0160 \u2014 Locked NuGet restore; PR runs Release test legs only; release.yml job split", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "PO decision 2026-10-01 (v0.23.0 CI board G-20/G-05/G-21). Every restore is --locked-mode against committed packages.lock.json. On pull_request the Debug legs build but skip tests; pushes to main/release/tags keep the full matrix. The skip is per step so job names stay stable for CI Gate."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_d_025", "label": "D-025 \u2014 Platform support boundary (Windows CI-verified; macOS by design; Linux launches, advisory)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ratified by the Product Owner 2026-09-05. The distinction between launch evidence and formal CI verification is retained; Linux is not recorded as supported without qualification."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_treatwarningsaserrors_at_ci_only", "label": "TreatWarningsAsErrors applied at the CI build step only", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Directory.Build.props deliberately leaves it false so a local dotnet build behaves as always; CI enforces the '0 Warnings' bar mechanically. Confirmed the tree built clean under the flag before the workflow was written, so this closes a gap rather than adding a failure mode."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_diagnostic_output_is_never_a_gate", "label": "Diagnostic output (summaries, artefact uploads) is never a verification gate", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "continue-on-error on summary and upload steps after run 33240113523 failed on an account-level artefact storage quota and run 33659184434 failed the job on an unparsable .trx path while tests had passed. Build, Test, Governance and CI Gate remain hard gates."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_sha_pinned_actions", "label": "Every GitHub Action pinned to a full commit SHA", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Minimal supply-chain surface; version kept in a trailing comment so Dependabot can update both."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_cancel_in_progress_pr_only", "label": "cancel-in-progress applies to pull request runs only", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Runs #420-#427 on release/v0.21.0 were each cancelled by the next push, so seven consecutive heads were never gated (v0.23.0 CI board G-22). A landed ref is gated in its own right; a PR's intermediate heads are not release candidates."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_late_startup_markers", "label": "Late-startup log markers 'Host -> Running.' and 'Desktop -> Composed.'", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "WP 16.1A-R1 / TD-154: still-running-at-timeout is not evidence of a launch; a deadlock after Avalonia init passed identically. 'Host -> Running.' alone only proved the Runtime Host pipeline; MainWindowComposer.Layout's 'Desktop -> Composed.' is required too."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_wp_11_1a", "label": "WP 11.1A \u2014 Continuous Integration & Build Verification", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_wp_11_2a", "label": "WP 11.2A \u2014 Governance Health-Check Tool", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_wp_20_3d", "label": "WP 20.3D \u2014 Test matrix sharding by test group", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_wp_21_5e", "label": "WP 21.5E / WP RC.0C \u2014 Dependency vulnerability scan is a required CI check", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_wp_16_5b", "label": "WP 16.5B \u2014 Linux/X11 launch spike (Avalonia 11.3.20, Tmds.DBus.Protocol 0.21.3)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_wp_17_0c", "label": "WP 17.0C \u2014 Mutation testing and code coverage collection", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_governance_healthcheck_script", "label": "scripts/governance-healthcheck.ps1", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_check_vulnerable_packages_script", "label": "scripts/check-vulnerable-packages.ps1", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_run_realshell_linux_script", "label": "scripts/run-realshell-linux.sh", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "_github_workflows_ci_ci", "target": "_github_workflows_ci_build_and_test", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_ci_ci", "target": "_github_workflows_ci_governance_health_check", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_ci_ci", "target": "_github_workflows_ci_dependency_scan", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_ci_ci", "target": "_github_workflows_ci_linux_launch_smoke", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_ci_ci", "target": "_github_workflows_ci_mutation", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_ci_ci", "target": "_github_workflows_ci_gate", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_ci_gate", "target": "_github_workflows_ci_build_and_test", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_ci_gate", "target": "_github_workflows_ci_governance_health_check", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_ci_gate", "target": "_github_workflows_ci_dependency_scan", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_ci_ci", "target": "_github_workflows_ci_wp_11_1a", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_ci_governance_health_check", "target": "_github_workflows_ci_wp_11_2a", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_ci_build_and_test", "target": "_github_workflows_ci_wp_20_3d", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_ci_dependency_scan", "target": "_github_workflows_ci_wp_21_5e", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_ci_linux_launch_smoke", "target": "_github_workflows_ci_wp_16_5b", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_ci_mutation", "target": "_github_workflows_ci_wp_17_0c", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_ci_build_and_test", "target": "_github_workflows_ci_test_sharding", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_ci_build_and_test", "target": "_github_workflows_ci_adr_0160", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_ci_gate", "target": "_github_workflows_ci_adr_0160", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_ci_governance_health_check", "target": "_github_workflows_ci_governance_healthcheck_script", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_ci_governance_health_check", "target": "contributing_markdown_budget", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_ci_dependency_scan", "target": "_github_workflows_ci_check_vulnerable_packages_script", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/